%% ARCH v4.0.0 — 入口 A（全盘 AI 解读）完整档调用序列
%% 场景：detail = full，5 个模块任务走滑动窗口（最高并发数 N=3，起速每秒 1 个），
%%       全部落定后融合任务单独执行。
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant V as AiWorkspaceView
    participant R as aiReadingRunner
    participant P as aiReadingPlan
    participant S as aiScheduler
    participant C as aiClient (explain)
    participant F as aiTokenFallback
    participant T as aiTransport
    participant E as aiEvidence
    participant U as stores/ui · useAiStatus

    V->>P: planReading({entry:'full', detail:'full', style, chart})
    P->>P: build A1..A5 tasks + A6 fusion
    P-->>V: ReadingPlan{tasks:5, fusion:A6, singleShot:false}

    V->>R: runReading(plan, cfg, {maxConcurrency:3, signal})
    R->>U: setAiReport(空壳) / setAiProgress(done 0 / total 6)
    R->>S: runSlidingWindow(tasks, {maxConcurrency:3, startIntervalMs:1000, retry:1})

    Note over S: t=0s 启动 A1（inFlight=1）
    S->>C: explain(A1, maxTokens=128000)
    C->>F: 首次尝试 step=128000
    F->>T: POST /chat/completions (max_tokens:128000)
    T-->>F: 200 ok
    F-->>C: body
    C->>E: checkEvidenceCoverage(reply, facts)
    E-->>C: {total, withEvidence, missing}
    C-->>S: A1 正文
    S->>U: onSettled(A1) → 分项即时上屏
    Note over S: t=1s 启动 A2（inFlight=2）
    S->>C: explain(A2)
    Note over S: t=2s 启动 A3（inFlight=3）→ rampDone=true
    S->>C: explain(A3)

    alt A1 返回 HTTP 400「max_tokens too large」
        T-->>F: 400 + body 命中越界措辞
        F->>F: isMaxTokensRejection → true；nextMaxTokensStep(128000)=64000
        F->>T: 仅本条重试 POST (max_tokens:64000)
        T-->>F: 200 ok
        Note over F: 降级状态只存在于本条调用栈，A2/A3 仍从 128000 起
    end

    S->>C: A2 完成 → 立即补发 A4（不等待下一个 tick）
    S->>C: A3 完成 → 立即补发 A5
    Note over S: done=5, inFlight=0, queued=0

    R->>R: 聚合 orderedSections()（按任务原始顺序 A1..A5）
    R->>C: explain(A6 full-fusion, offline=fusionExcerptChars 各 800 字)
    C-->>R: 融合正文
    R->>R: splitFusion(raw) → {fusion, summary}
    R->>U: setAiReport(FullReport) / finish('completed')
    R-->>V: FullReport{entry:'full', sections, fusion, summary, skipped}

    opt 用户点击取消
        V->>R: abort()
        R->>S: signal.abort()
        Note over S: 不再启动新任务；在跑任务收到 abort；已落定结果保留
        S-->>R: throw AiError('已取消','cancelled')
        R->>U: setAiLoading(false)（不写伪造内容、不进融合）
    end
